<title>USA: Conductus wins ClearSite order.</title>
<headline>Conductus wins ClearSite order.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conductus Inc, a maker of products using superconductive electronics, said cellular service operator Cellcom will purchase four of Conductus' ClearSite systems after successful tests.</p>
<p>In a statement, Conductus said the order is the largest single commercial order of superconductive filter subsystems.</p>
<p>In addition, Cellcom is evaluating how many more sites should be upgraded with Conductus systems, the company said.</p>
<p>The Cellcom trials showed dropped call rates decreased by 20 percent on average using ClearSite, and the product met all expectations for performance and serviceability.</p>
</text>
